{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18258","headline":"晚次宣溪辱韵州张端公使君惠书叙别酬以绝句二章 一 · 韩愈","name":"晚次宣溪辱韵州张端公使君惠书叙别酬以绝句二章 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韶州南去接宣溪，云水苍茫日向西。\n客泪数行先自落，鹧鸪休傍耳边啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}